        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wake up to the water every single day. Trade Winds sits right on the waterfront, moments from the moorings and the Waterford greenway, with the town’s amenities just around the corner. This is a property that sells a lifestyle as much as a home.\r\n\r\nThis three-bedroom, three-bathroom home is presented in turnkey condition, so there’s nothing to do here but move in and start enjoying it. The property is gated, offering privacy and security, with private car parking and an outdoor space perfect for morning coffee or evening drinks.\r\n\r\nThe location is a major part of the appeal. Set in the heart of Dungarvan, with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, and amenities within a short stroll.\r\n\r\nDungarvan has become one of the south-east's most desirable places to live, renowned for its thriving food scene, coastal setting, and excellent access to outdoor recreation. Nearby beaches, including Clonea Strand, together with the Comeragh Mountains and surrounding countryside, provide plenty of opportunities to enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nHomes like this waterfront, walk-in ready, and this close to everything don’t come along often. Viewing with Liberty Blue Estate Agents is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***Liberty Blue Estate Agents and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up-to-date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied upon as a representation of fact. Subject to contract. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must satisfy themselves as to the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs are provided for guidance purposes only.***"
      },
